on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [  5] extcall 42 .............................. <soundBusy(1)>
  [  8] not ..................................... <not soundBusy(1)>
  [  9] jmpifz [ 27] ............................ if not soundBusy(1) then / else
  [ 12] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 15] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [ 17] extcall 41 .............................. <marker(1)>
  [ 20] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <marker(1)>
  [ 22] extcall 2 ............................... go(marker(1))
  [ 24] jmp [ 37]
  [ 27] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 28] pusharglist 1 ........................... <0>
  [ 30] extcall 41 .............................. <marker(0)>
  [ 33] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <marker(0)>
  [ 35] extcall 2 ............................... go(marker(0))
  [ 37] ret
end
